    <bpmn:process id="W_W5141" name="W5141. Agricultural-to-Commercial Land Reclassification Application (LGU level)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site has agricultural zoning but is suitable for retail store
Frequency: Event-driven per site reclassification necessity
Volume: ~5–7 applications annually
Owner: Regulatory Compliance Officer / Land Liaison Officer
Participants: Municipal/City Zoning Board, Sanggunian Bayan/Panglungsod (LGU Council), Municipal/City Planning Officer
Source: workflow W5141 — Agricultural-to-Commercial Land Reclassification Application (LGU level)</bpmn:documentation>
