        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-765 (ensure controlled execution — Agrarian Reform, NCIP Ancestral Domain &amp; Land Use Conversion Operations (PA-178.2).) | - CTL-765: Certified true copy of Sanggunian Reclassification Ordinance secured and published as legally mandated.
Owner: Regulatory Compliance Officer / Land Liaison Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
