    <bpmn:process id="W_W5142" name="W5142. Land Use Conversion Order Application (DAR Central/Regional level)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LGU Reclassification Ordinance secured (W5141) for agricultural land
Frequency: Event-driven per site conversion
Volume: ~5–7 applications annually
Owner: Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Participants: Department of Agrarian Reform (DAR) — Center for Land Use Policy, Planning and Implementation (CLUPPI) at the Central Office, or the Regional CLUPPI (RCLUPPI) for smaller tracts
Source: workflow W5142 — Land Use Conversion Order Application (DAR Central/Regional level)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5142_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5142_Lane1" name="Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5142_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5142_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5142_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5142_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5142_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5142_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5142_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5142_Start3" name="LGU Reclassification Ordinance secured (W5141) for agricultural land">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5142_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5142_Task4" name="File formal Application for Land Use Conversion at the DAR Provincial/Regional…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: File formal Application for Land Use Conversion at the DAR Provincial/Regional Office.
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5142_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5142_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5142_Task5" name="Submit comprehensive folder: TCT, LGU Reclassification Ordinance, City Zoning…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Submit comprehensive folder: TCT, LGU Reclassification Ordinance, City Zoning locational clearance, DA Certificate of Eligibility, and DENR ECC.
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5142_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5142_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5142_Task6" name="Arrange joint CLUPPI site inspection and post public notice of conversion on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Arrange joint CLUPPI site inspection and post public notice of conversion on the property for public inspection.
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5142_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5142_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5142_Task7" name="Pay conversion fees and post the required performance bond to guarantee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Pay conversion fees and post the required performance bond to guarantee development (VS-116).
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5142_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5142_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5142_Task8" name="Secure the signed Land Use Conversion Order from the DAR Regional Director or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Secure the signed Land Use Conversion Order from the DAR Regional Director or Secretary (per DAR AO 1-02, as revised).
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5142_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5142_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5142_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5142_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5142_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-765 (ensure controlled execution — Agrarian Reform, NCIP Ancestral Domain &amp; Land Use Conversion Operations (PA-178.2).) | - CTL-765: DAR Conversion Order verified by Legal; performance bond posted and audited (VS-116/VS-21).
Owner: Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Land Legal Specialist</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
